{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24808","headline":"和刘梦得岁夜怀友 · 卢贞","name":"和刘梦得岁夜怀友","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"文翰走天下，琴尊卧洛阳。\n贞元朝士尽，新岁一悲凉。\n名早缘才大，官迟爲寿长。\n时来知病已，莫叹步趋妨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢贞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24808.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24808","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}